{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07441","headline":"寻龙井杨老 · 刘长卿","name":"寻龙井杨老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柴门草舍绝风尘，空谷耕田学子真。\n泉咽恐劳经陇底，山深不觉有秦人。\n手栽松树苍苍老，身卧桃园寂寂春。\n唯有胡麻当鸡黍，白云来往未嫌贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}